"mt_T76hKqXf0z":{"intro":"Group numbers to make adding easy! 🧺","items":[{"t":"type","q":"2 + 6 + 4 = ? Hint: add 6 + 4 first. Type the number.","a":["12","twelve"],"why":"6 + 4 = 10, then 10 + 2 = 12."},{"t":"tf","q":"(3 + 5) + 2 gives the same total as 3 + (5 + 2).","a":true,"why":"Both make 10. Grouping does not change the sum."},{"t":"pick","q":"In 7 + 8 + 3, which two are smartest to add first?","opts":["7 + 3","7 + 8","8 + 3"],"why":"7 + 3 = 10, then 10 + 8 = 18."},{"t":"type","q":"5 + 9 + 5 = ? Type the number.","a":["19","nineteen"],"why":"5 + 5 = 10, then 10 + 9 = 19."},{"t":"pick","q":"For 4 + 2 + 6, which grouping makes a ten?","opts":["(4 + 6) + 2","(4 + 2) + 6","(2 + 6) + 4"],"why":"4 + 6 = 10, then add 2 to get 12."}]},
